{"kind":"final","text":"Done. The fault was that all three animateTransform elements had begin="indefinite", so they never auto-started (activeAnimations was empty).

Fix: one patch removed only the begin attribute from back-spin, front-spin, and pedal-spin, letting each use the SVG default begin of 0s. Nothing else changed — element tree, ids, dur=1.6s, from/to rotate centers (250 400, 550 400, 398 400), attributeName/type/repeatCount, and all artwork remain identical (geometryPreserved=true).

Verification: after the write, pelican.verify reported passed=true with activeAnimations=[back-spin, front-spin, pedal-spin] and moving wheel-back, wheel-front, pedal all changed=true. File sha256 went 2cb627…→60459c…, byteLength 2566→2509 (removing the three begin attributes)."}
